<view class="page"><view class="brand">时序 · 邀请内测</view><view class="title">给重要的事，留一个位置。</view><view class="subtitle">微信登录后，日程在手机与网页之间继续。</view><view class="card"><view class="field"><view class="label">邀请码（新用户填写）</view><input value="{{inviteCode}}" data-field="inviteCode" bindinput="field" maxlength="35" placeholder="管理员发给你的 SX- 邀请码"/></view><view class="divider"/><view class="field"><view class="label">网页账号绑定码（已有账号填写）</view><input value="{{linkTicket}}" data-field="linkTicket" bindinput="field" maxlength="43" placeholder="网页“连接微信”生成，10分钟有效"/></view><view class="muted">已绑定的用户无需重复填写。两项均未填写时，只允许已有绑定的微信登录。</view><checkbox-group bindchange="accepted"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{accepted}}"/>我已阅读并同意内测隐私说明</label></checkbox-group><view class="link" bindtap="privacy">阅读隐私说明 →</view><view class="error" wx:if="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录并进入</button><view class="muted">本版暂不收费，不开放自由注册。</view></view></view>
